<section class="policy" id="terms" data-policy-section="terms">
  <h2>Terms &amp; Conditions</h2>
  <p>By booking a consultation with Visva Ved, you agree to these Terms and Conditions. Please read them carefully.</p>

  <h3>1. Services &amp; Bookings</h3>
