    <li><strong>Scope:</strong> We offer spiritual and holistic guidance through Numerology, Vastu Shastra, and Tarot via online, phone, or in-person sessions.</li>
    <li><strong>Payment:</strong> <strong>Full payment is required at the time of booking</strong> to confirm your appointment.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>2. Cancellations, Rescheduling &amp; Refunds</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>24-Hour Notice:</strong> You must notify us at least <strong>24 hours in advance</strong> to cancel or reschedule. Late changes may result in a forfeited booking fee.</li>
    <li><strong>Rescheduling:</strong> Changes depend entirely on our current availability.</li>
    <li><strong>Refunds:</strong> Only valid if the service does not match its description. You must file a written claim within <strong>48 hours</strong> after your session.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>3. Client Responsibility &amp; Liability</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>No Guarantees:</strong> Our guidance is intuitive and subjective. We do not guarantee specific life outcomes or results.</li>
    <li><strong>Client Autonomy:</strong> You assume full responsibility for all personal decisions and actions taken after your consultation.</li>
    <li><strong>Technical Setup:</strong> You must provide accurate details and ensure a stable connection. We are not liable for technical issues on your end.</li>
    <li><strong>Liability Limit:</strong> Visva Ved is not liable for any indirect or consequential damages arising from the use of our services.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>4. Legal &amp; Contact</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Changes:</strong> We reserve the right to update these terms at any time without prior notice.</li>
    <li><strong>Governing Law:</strong> These terms are governed by the <strong>laws of India</strong>, and any disputes will fall under Indian jurisdiction.</li>
    <li><strong>Contact Us:</strong> For support, email <a href="mailto:visvaved@gmail.com">visvaved@gmail.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+917208173256">+91 7208173256</a>.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="policy" id="privacy" data-policy-section="privacy">
  <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
  <p>By using our website or booking a consultation, you agree to this Privacy Policy.</p>

  <h3>1. Data We Collect &amp; Use</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Information Collected:</strong> We collect your name, contact details, payment info, and consultation data (birth date/time/place, family details, or Vastu layouts).</li>
    <li><strong>Purpose:</strong> Your data is used solely to schedule sessions, process secure payments, provide customer support, and send optional marketing emails (which you can opt out of anytime).</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>2. Ethical Limits &amp; Sharing</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Strict Restrictions:</strong> We <strong>do not</strong> collect data for, or answer queries about, <strong>prenatal sex determination or exact time of death</strong>. Such requests will be rejected and the data permanently deleted.</li>
    <li><strong>Third-Party Sharing:</strong> We <strong>never sell or rent your data</strong>. We only share it with trusted service providers (like payment gateways) under strict confidentiality, or if legally required.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>3. Security, Cookies &amp; Minors</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Security:</strong> We use industry-standard measures to protect your data, though no digital storage is 100% secure.</li>
    <li><strong>Cookies &amp; Links:</strong> Cookies are used to improve website function. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of external links on our site.</li>
    <li><strong>Minors:</strong> Our services are strictly for individuals <strong>18 years or older</strong>. Data from minors will be deleted immediately upon discovery.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>4. Your Rights &amp; Contact</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Your Control:</strong> You can review, update, or request the deletion of your personal data at any time.</li>
    <li><strong>Contact:</strong> Email <a href="mailto:visvaved@gmail.com">visvaved@gmail.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+917208173256">+91 7208173256</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>Updates:</strong> We may modify this policy at any time; updates take effect immediately upon posting.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="policy" id="refund" data-policy-section="refund">
  <h2>Refund Policy</h2>
  <p>We strive to provide high-quality spiritual guidance. Because our services are intuitive and subjective, refunds are granted only under strict criteria.</p>

  <h3>1. Eligibility Criteria</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Valid Grounds:</strong> Refunds are only considered if the consultation <strong>fundamentally failed to match</strong> the service description.</li>
    <li><strong>Subjective Dissatisfaction:</strong> Claims based on personal dislike of the guidance are subject to internal review. Visva Ved reserves the final right to approve or deny claims.</li>
    <li><strong>No-Shows &amp; Overtime:</strong> Refunds are <strong>strictly unavailable</strong> for missed sessions, late arrivals, or sessions that run past their scheduled time.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>2. How to Claim</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>48-Hour Window:</strong> You must submit your request in writing <strong>within 48 hours</strong> of the completed session. Late claims are automatically disqualified.</li>
    <li><strong>Required Details:</strong> Send your full name, booking date/time, service type, and a detailed explanation of the deviation to <a href="mailto:visvaved@gmail.com">visvaved@gmail.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+917208173256">+91 7208173256</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>3. Processing &amp; Updates</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Review:</strong> Our team will evaluate the session details and may contact you for further clarification.</li>
    <li><strong>Payout:</strong> Approved refunds are credited back to the original payment method within <strong>7 to 10 business days</strong>.</li>
    <li><strong>Changes:</strong> We reserve the right to update this policy at any time for new bookings.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

